.SH EXAMPLES
One vulnerable\->fixed pair per ecosystem (C).
.SS C
\fIVulnerable:\fR
.RS
.EX
free(p);
/* ... */
free(p);                     /* double free */
.EE
.RE
\fIFixed:\fR
.RS
.EX
